will be through da\u2019wah & ideology.\"", "last_comment_created": 1785688736912, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": true, "comments": 4, "score_up": 29, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "\u262a\ufe0f\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u262a\ufe0f", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATC4nlMoh", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 54, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8759597, "raw_content": "", "author": "MarshallB", "created": 1785671200168, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "MarshallB", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATC4nlMoh.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/in7F3YrafCkH.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/dhPviTu8OvBEwIUL.jpeg", "width": 241, "content-type": "jpeg", "height": 360}], "blurhash": "UGBV;LS}MdIo9vaLR*xaI[r?Nat6~BXSnPIo", "full_resolution": [360, 241]}, "title": "You can't trust the science when the scientists are CORRUPT!", "last_comment_created": 1785672053484, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": true, "comments": 2, "score_up": 54, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATC4nmBd3", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 31, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "peace", "id": 8759841, "raw_content": "The Direct Case: Administrative obfuscation while satisfying the scientific definition\r\n\u200b\r\n\r\nDirect Authority: As head of NIAID, Anthony Fauci personally controlled the operational definitions and grant-review processes that determined what triggered oversight.\r\n\r\n**\u200bBiological Fact:** The NIH funded research that engineered chimeric viruses to increase human cell binding and replication\u2014the literal biological definition of gain-of-function.\r\n\u200b\r\n\r\n**Textual Breach:** The 2017 P3CO framework mandated review for research \"reasonably anticipated\" to enhance pathogens\u2014a plain-text standard the physical proposal satisfied.\r\n\r\n**Arbitrary Goalpost Shift:** Fauci applied an unwritten, extreme standard (requiring proof of epidemic spread) to claim the research didn't meet the rule, bypassing his own agency's committee.\r\n\r\n**The Funding Impossibility:** He approved taxpayer funds on the premise that the genetic modifications were highly likely to work, while simultaneously claiming under oath they were unlikely to work to avoid biosecurity review.\r\n\r\n\r\n\u200bBy controlling the definitions, he manufactured an administrative loop: using his authority to narrow the rules internally, then pointing to those narrowed rules under oath to deny the biological reality. Even under his own P3CO framework, his claim that it wasn't gain of fuction research fails.", "author": "TonsOfSalt", "created": 1785682493606, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "FUSnowflake", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Bulletproof breakdown of Anthony Fauci lying to congress.", "last_comment_created": 1785688455393, "content": "<p>The Direct Case: Administrative obfuscation while satisfying the scientific definition\n\u200b</p>\n<p>Direct Authority: As head of NIAID, Anthony Fauci personally controlled the operational definitions and grant-review processes that determined what triggered oversight.</p>\n<p><strong>\u200bBiological Fact:</strong> The NIH funded research that engineered chimeric viruses to increase human cell binding and replication\u2014the literal biological definition of gain-of-function.\n\u200b</p>\n<p><strong>Textual Breach:</strong> The 2017 P3CO framework mandated review for research &quot;reasonably anticipated&quot; to enhance pathogens\u2014a plain-text standard the physical proposal satisfied.</p>\n<p><strong>Arbitrary Goalpost Shift:</strong> Fauci applied an unwritten, extreme standard (requiring proof of epidemic spread) to claim the research didn't meet the rule, bypassing his own agency's committee.</p>\n<p><strong>The Funding Impossibility:</strong> He approved taxpayer funds on the premise that the genetic modifications were highly likely to work, while simultaneously claiming under oath they were unlikely to work to avoid biosecurity review.</p>\n<p>\u200bBy controlling the definitions, he manufactured an administrative loop: using his authority to narrow the rules internally, then pointing to those narrowed rules under oath to deny the biological reality. Even under his own P3CO framework, his claim that it wasn't gain of fuction research fails.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 9, "score_up": 31, "is_edited": true, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "\ud83d\udc89\u00a0\u00a0GET\u00a0\u